cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use cellweave in your work, please cite it as below, with the version you used."
title: "cellweave: a multiscale simulator of tissues and tumours, cell by cell"
abstract: "cellweave couples a Cellular Potts model of cells, a network of proteins inside every cell read from a file, and reaction-diffusion fields between them, and sets the tissues it grows against public measurements. It is experimental: its results are hypotheses to test."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Godzik
    given-names: Nicolas
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ngodzik/cellweave"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-30
keywords:
  - cellular Potts model
  - multiscale modelling
  - tumour growth
  - lineage tracing
  - spheroids
